WEBVTT

00:00:54.836 --> 00:01:00.516
I'll start by saying that in my lifetime,

00:01:00.556 --> 00:01:06.716
the most important geopolitical artifact
is the fall of the Berlin Wall.

00:01:06.756 --> 00:01:08.716
I mean, you see it

00:01:08.756 --> 00:01:11.476
if you go into the new
NATO headquarters in Brussels,

00:01:11.516 --> 00:01:13.516
just built a few years ago.

00:01:13.556 --> 00:01:16.636
And anyone that has a piece,
something they're very proud of,

00:01:16.676 --> 00:01:18.636
they know it affected their entire lives.

00:01:18.676 --> 00:01:20.556
I think that in 30 years' time,

00:01:20.556 --> 00:01:22.476
and I fear that in 30 years' time,

00:01:22.516 --> 00:01:24.076
if we look back,

00:01:24.076 --> 00:01:28.316
a second most important
geopolitical artifact

00:01:28.356 --> 00:01:32.796
will be a piece of the rubble
of the Maidan in Kyiv.